                        <span class="text-gradient">About Us</span>
                    </h2>
                    <p class="lead text-muted mb-4" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="200">
                        Our practice, located in the heart of Tunis, offers a warm and confidential 
                        environment dedicated to mental health and emotional well-being. We provide 
                        personalized consultations, combining medical expertise and therapeutic 
                        techniques such as hypnosis, to accompany each patient toward lasting well-being.
                    </p>
                   
                    <div class="location-info" data-aos="fade-up" data-aos-delay="400">
